This fork updates Font Awesome to Free 7.3.1, adapts glyph font selection,
replaces the Gradle/Bintray build with Maven, and adds a standalone icon viewer under io.github.jimmyboombots3000.
Maven artifacts use the io.github.jimmyboombots3000 group ID.
Font styling also preserves icon fonts and caller styles through resizing.
It is an independent fork, not an official release by Jens Deters.

